# Website (Astro)

## Role

`apps/web` is the **marketing / legal / waitlist** surface. It is not the mobile app
and not a full product SPA unless the human explicitly expands scope.

## Stack discipline

- Static-first Astro pages.
- Use React islands only when interactivity truly needs them.
- Do not introduce Next.js, Remix, or a design-system rewrite for marketing pages.

## Sharing

- Brand tokens/assets: `@product/brand`.
- Do **not** share React Native components with the website.
- API calls (waitlist, etc.) go through the contract/client — not ad-hoc backends in Astro.

## SEO and legal

Every public page needs sound metadata. Privacy/terms stay real pages, not placeholders that ship empty.
